abstract: "Supplementary materials for the Applied Acoustics paper \"Latency and anchor dependence in objective binaural quality metrics: a cross-format evaluation of immersive audio\": the stimulus conditioning and scoring pipeline, scored BAM-Q and BINAQUAL predictions for every format, content item and reference anchor, the render-chain configuration behind each commercial format variant, and the reproducible statistical analysis with the per-figure data tables behind every figure in the paper."
